      }, {
        "id" : "4aa77ec0-3c56-4160-958d-3f6b85f0d912",
        "renditionValue" : {
          "componentAttributes" : {
            "richTextValue" : "<div class='slds-grid slds-grid--vertical slds-align--absolute-center slds-container--large'><div class='slds-align-middle slds-m-bottom--xx-large slds-m-top--xx-large' alt='Page not available'><img src='/sfsites/c/img/community/slds/messaging/illustration-page-not-found.png' class='slds-p-horizontal--large'/></div><h4 class='slds-text-align--center slds-text-heading--large slds-text-color--weak slds-m-bottom--small'>Страница недоступна</h4><p class='slds-text-align--center slds-text-heading--medium slds-text-color--weak'>Возможно страница была удалена, введен неверный URL, или что-то пошло не так. Если вы знаете, что страница точно существует, и вы не можете ее открыть, обратитесь за помощью к администратору сообщества.</p></div>"
          }
        },
        "type" : "renditionComponent"
      }, {
        "id" : "12ca16b7-25b4-4dac-af3e-61cab5db93ae",
        "renditionValue" : {
          "componentAttributes" : {
            "richTextValue" : "<div class='slds-grid slds-grid--vertical slds-align--absolute-center slds-container--large'><div class='slds-align-middle slds-m-bottom--xx-large slds-m-top--xx-large' alt='Page not available'><img src='/sfsites/c/img/community/slds/messaging/illustration-page-not-found.png' class='slds-p-horizontal--large'/></div><h4 class='slds-text-align--center slds-text-heading--large slds-text-color--weak slds-m-bottom--small'>P&aacute;gina n&atilde;o dispon&iacute;vel</h4><p class='slds-text-align--center slds-text-heading--medium slds-text-color--weak'>A p&aacute;gina pode ter sido exclu&iacute;da, a URL pode estar incorreta ou pode ter ocorrido algum outro erro. Se voc&ecirc; sabe que a p&aacute;gina existe, mas ainda assim n&atilde;o consegue acess&aacute;-la, pe&ccedil;a ajuda ao administrador da comunidade.</p></div>"
          }
        },
        "type" : "renditionComponent"
      }, {
        "id" : "b828aad1-4182-45fe-83cd-31216bbaf571",
        "renditionValue" : {
          "componentAttributes" : {
            "richTextValue" : "<div class='slds-grid slds-grid--vertical slds-align--absolute-center slds-container--large'><div class='slds-align-middle slds-m-bottom--xx-large slds-m-top--xx-large' alt='Page not available'><img src='/sfsites/c/img/community/slds/messaging/illustration-page-not-found.png' class='slds-p-horizontal--large'/></div><h4 class='slds-text-align--center slds-text-heading--large slds-text-color--weak slds-m-bottom--small'>ページを表示できません</h4><p class='slds-text-align--center slds-text-heading--medium slds-text-color--weak'>ページが削除されている、URL に間違いがある、またはそのほかの問題がある可能性があります。確実にページが存在しているにもかかわらず表示されない場合、コミュニティーの管理者にお問い合わせください。</p></div>"
          }
        },
        "type" : "renditionComponent"
      }, {
        "id" : "c4704d07-a164-4ff3-86d6-30bf451e4e4b",
        "renditionValue" : {
          "componentAttributes" : {
            "richTextValue" : "<div class='slds-grid slds-grid--vertical slds-align--absolute-center slds-container--large'><div class='slds-align-middle slds-m-bottom--xx-large slds-m-top--xx-large' alt='Page not available'><img src='/sfsites/c/img/community/slds/messaging/illustration-page-not-found.png' class='slds-p-horizontal--large'/></div><h4 class='slds-text-align--center slds-text-heading--large slds-text-color--weak slds-m-bottom--small'>Pagina non disponibile</h4><p class='slds-text-align--center slds-text-heading--medium slds-text-color--weak'>La pagina potrebbe essere stata eliminata, l&apos;URL potrebbe essere sbagliato o qualcos&apos;altro &egrave; andato storto. Se si &egrave; certi che la pagina esiste ma non si riesce ad accedervi, contattare l&rsquo;amministratore della community per assistenza.</p></div>"
          }
        },
        "type" : "renditionComponent"
      }, {
        "id" : "8b022260-0693-4085-8835-f3fa6907f462",
        "renditionValue" : {
          "componentAttributes" : {
            "richTextValue" : "<div class='slds-grid slds-grid--vertical slds-align--absolute-center slds-container--large'><div class='slds-align-middle slds-m-bottom--xx-large slds-m-top--xx-large' alt='Page not available'><img src='/sfsites/c/img/community/slds/messaging/illustration-page-not-found.png' class='slds-p-horizontal--large'/></div><h4 class='slds-text-align--center slds-text-heading--large slds-text-color--weak slds-m-bottom--small'>Page non disponible</h4><p class='slds-text-align--center slds-text-heading--medium slds-text-color--weak'>Il est possible que la page ait &eacute;t&eacute; supprim&eacute;e, que l&apos;URL soit incorrecte, ou que quelque chose d&apos;autre se soit pass&eacute;. Si vous ne parvenez toujours pas &agrave; acc&eacute;der &agrave; la page alors que vous savez qu&apos;elle existe, demandez de l&apos;aide &agrave; l&apos;administrateur de la communaut&eacute;.</p></div>"
          }
        },
        "type" : "renditionComponent"
      }, {
        "id" : "c7b530fb-7959-4365-a191-e1359309e040",
        "renditionValue" : {
          "componentAttributes" : {
            "richTextValue" : "<div class='slds-grid slds-grid--vertical slds-align--absolute-center slds-container--large'><div class='slds-align-middle slds-m-bottom--xx-large slds-m-top--xx-large' alt='Page not available'><img src='/sfsites/c/img/community/slds/messaging/illustration-page-not-found.png' class='slds-p-horizontal--large'/></div><h4 class='slds-text-align--center slds-text-heading--large slds-text-color--weak slds-m-bottom--small'>P&aacute;gina no disponible</h4><p class='slds-text-align--center slds-text-heading--medium slds-text-color--weak'>Tal vez la p&aacute;gina se elimin&oacute;, la URL es incorrecta, o algo m&aacute;s sali&oacute; mal. Si sabe que la p&aacute;gina existe pero aun as&iacute; no puede llegar a ella, por favor p&iacute;dale ayuda al administrador de la comunidad.</p></div>"
          }
        },
        "type" : "renditionComponent"
      }, {
        "id" : "83ab1b98-fa0a-4293-a5d2-91269f7b69fa",
        "renditionValue" : {
          "componentAttributes" : {
            "richTextValue" : "<div class='slds-grid slds-grid--vertical slds-align--absolute-center slds-container--large'><div class='slds-align-middle slds-m-bottom--xx-large slds-m-top--xx-large' alt='Page not available'><img src='/sfsites/c/img/community/slds/messaging/illustration-page-not-found.png' class='slds-p-horizontal--large'/></div><h4 class='slds-text-align--center slds-text-heading--large slds-text-color--weak slds-m-bottom--small'>Seite nicht verf&uuml;gbar</h4><p class='slds-text-align--center slds-text-heading--medium slds-text-color--weak'>Es k&ouml;nnte sein, dass die Seite gel&ouml;scht wurde, der URL nicht stimmt oder etwas anderes nicht funktioniert hat. Wenn Sie sicher wissen, dass die Seite existiert und Sie k&ouml;nnen immer noch nicht darauf zugreifen, dann fragen Sie bitte den Community-Administrator nach Hilfe.</p></div>"
